---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import gitData from "../../public/git_personal_stats.json";
import { ContributionDashboard } from "../features/stats";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Hi, It's me!">
  <img src="/sumoiscoding.png" class="h-auto w-36" />
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert">
    <span class="italic">Hi 👋, my name is</span>
    <h1>Sumanth Kashyap</h1>
    <article>
      <p>
        I develop software for living. You can find me tinkering with Django,
        React and many more cool stuff at <a
          href="https://gstzen.in/cloudzen-info"
          target="_blank"
          class="underline hover:text-blue-500">CloudZen Software Labs</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether it's fiction, non-fiction, or technical literature, I'm
        facinated by all.
        <br />Currently, my interests lie in.... hmm... lets see....
        <ul>
          <li>Data structures</li>
          <li>Villans of Ayn Rand</li>
          <li>Distributed systems</li>
          <li>
            Austrian school of economics and the monetary significance of
            distributed currencies
          </li>
          <li>Concepts of tokenization and vector databases.</li>
          <li>... and more!</li>
        </ul>
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not deep into a projects, you'll likely find me experimenting
        with new technologies, doing heavy squats or <a
          href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/12062615"
          target="_blank">cycling</a
        > through the scenic countryside around Bengaluru.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div
    class="text-primary flex flex-col items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-200 p-6 md:flex-row dark:bg-slate-800"
  >
    <ul class="list-inside list-none">
      <li>
        <strong>WeightLifting</strong>:
        <span class="font-semibold">SQT</span>:180kg,
        <span class="font-semibold">DL</span>:220kg,
        <span class="font-semibold">BP</span>:110kg,
        <span class="font-semibold">OHP</span>:80kg,
      </li>
      <li><strong>Cycling</strong>: SR-2025</li>
    </ul>
    <Image src="/cool-sumo.png" alt="Cool Sumo" width={250} height={250} />
  </div>
  <div class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Contribution Dashboard</h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 text-sm">
      You don't see me much on GitHub, because I'm busy cooking at
      <a
        href="https://gstzen.in/cloudzen-info"
        target="_blank"
        class="underline hover:text-blue-500">CloudZen</a
      >
    </p>
    <ContributionDashboard data={gitData} client:load />
  </div>
</Layout>
